":"arrival_run chosen for best RECALL among the six FlameFlux v3 candidates on the production-valid t0-window corpus (R=0.624 on the fc2 held-out fires, R=0.432 on Dillon -- see candidate_comparison.md from the 2026-07-24 comparison). It does NOT meet the project's P>=0.50/R>=0.80 target: precision is the WORST of the six (P=0.120 on fc2 -- most flagged growth is wrong), and wind_run actually edges it on F1. IMPORTANT CAVEAT: arrival_run trained on the leaky 'observed' corpus (crop centered/sized on t0|t1, i.e. it saw the future perimeter's geometry during training) and has NEVER seen a t0-window crop -- the ONLY geometry this live pipeline can ever produce at forecast time (the future perimeter is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-08-08 14:26:22.865147+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-08-08 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-08-09 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-08-08 14:05:09+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":21,"degraded_history":false,"containment_pct":1,"acres_wfigs":97538.21069475975,"hour":5,"valid_at_utc":"2026-08-08 05:00:00"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-120.71555,47.88726],[-120.71595,47.88726],[-120.71595,47.88753],[-120.71555,47.88753],[-120.71555,47.88726]]],[[[-120.71837,47.88807],[-120.71877,47.88807],[-120.71877,47.88834],[-120.71837,47.88834],[-120.71837,47.88807]]],[[[-120.71958,47.88861],[-120.71998,47.88861],[-